{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳欣茵身材驕人，被譽為新生代「咪神」的她，日前相約一班KOL朋友去越南旅行，成班女仔穿着泳衣，圍在泳池邊嬉水，玩得十分開心，她說很難得與這班人出埠去玩，她覺得KOL是一份孤獨的職業，尤其是做旅遊KOL工作，長期不在港各有各飛，好多時一個</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:24:13.170854+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T03:18:10.193220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:18:10.193220+00:00","content_hash":"db05e566202e3f54262a9e3d76cfa13bdd11e61b6071b9793203621e0eda2222","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}